これな 何 何をするゲームなのじゃ？To stand, look up at the arrow on the edge of the counter. Counter, left click when you see stand up. オッケー スタンドアップ。
What kind of game is this? "To stand, look up at the arrow on the edge of the counter."
Counter, left click when you see "STAND UP." Okay, stand up.

