00:24:06,841 --> 00:24:22,961
ほう。Try it out, try to return to from the side, look up the arrow on the edge of the counter and left click when you see jump back. Press N, when you are back behind the original side of the counter...
Ho. "Try it out, try to return to from the side, look up the arrow on the edge of the counter and left click when you see 'JUMP BACK.'
